Subject: Backport the upstream libsoup GType changes to libsoup 2
Origin: Filnix, adapted from ports/patch/libsoup-3.4.4.patch
Upstream-Status: Adaptation for Nixpkgs libsoup 2.74.3

Keep enum registration and session-feature keys pointer-valued, and preserve
capabilities when adding the static-scope signal tag. libsoup 2 has an
additional tagged buffer signal. This local adaptation is separate from the
verbatim upstream libsoup 3 patch and survives port extraction.

